### POC 1 requests. Open in IntelliJ (HTTP Client) or VS Code (REST Client extension) and click "Send".
### Start the app first: java -jar tutor/target/tutor.jar

### Lesson 1a: same question, two system messages
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/messages

### Lesson 1b: temperature 0 vs 0.8 (each asked twice)
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/temperature

### Lesson 1c (break it): a framework that does not exist
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/made-up

### Lesson 2a: blocking. Nothing arrives until the whole answer is ready
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/blocking

### Lesson 2b: streaming. Best seen in a terminal: curl.exe -N http://localhost:8080/poc01/stream
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/stream

### Lesson 3: structured output into a Java record
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/concept-card?concept=embeddings

### Lesson 3 (break it): a made-up concept
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/concept-card?concept=Zorblax%20framework

### Lesson 4: chat WITHOUT memory (then send the follow-up below)
POST http://localhost:8080/poc01/chat/alice?memory=false
Content-Type: text/plain

What are embeddings?

### Lesson 4: follow-up WITHOUT memory. What is "it"?
POST http://localhost:8080/poc01/chat/alice?memory=false
Content-Type: text/plain

Give me an example of it.

### Lesson 4: chat WITH memory
POST http://localhost:8080/poc01/chat/alice
Content-Type: text/plain

What are embeddings?

### Lesson 4: follow-up WITH memory
POST http://localhost:8080/poc01/chat/alice
Content-Type: text/plain

Give me an example of it.

### Lesson 4: another user has their own, empty memory
POST http://localhost:8080/poc01/chat/bob
Content-Type: text/plain

Give me an example of it.

### Lesson 4: what is stored for alice (re-sent to the model on every call)
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/chat/alice/memory

### Lesson 4: forget alice's conversation
DELETE http://localhost:8080/poc01/chat/alice/memory

### Artifact: 3b vs 7b comparison (takes a few minutes), writes docs/artifacts/poc01-model-comparison.md
GET http://localhost:8080/poc01/model-comparison?models=qwen2.5:3b,qwen2.5:7b
